  "id": "USN-8733-1",
  "summary": "gzip vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Micha\u0142 Majchrowicz and Marcin Wyczechowski discovered that Gzip's gzexe\nutility created temporary files in an insecure manner when mktemp was\nunavailable. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to overwrite\narbitrary files. (CVE-2026-41991)\n\nElias Hasas, Micha\u0142 Majchrowicz and Marcin Wyczechowski discovered that Gzip incorrectly\nhandled certain compressed files. An attacker could possibly use this\nissue to obtain sensitive information or cause Gzip to crash, resulting\nin a denial of service. (CVE-2026-41992)",
